msgstr ""

#: package/contents/ui/config/configAutomation.qml:206
msgid "Pause live radio"
msgstr ""

#: package/contents/ui/config/configAutomation.qml:209
msgid ""
"While a station plays, a rolling copy of the broadcast is kept on this "
"computer. Pause parks it; Play picks up within a few seconds of where you "
"paused, behind live, and one tap on the pill catches back up. Stay paused "
"longer than the buffer holds and buffering stops: what was kept plays out, "
"then live radio returns. Stop, or a change of station, deletes the copy, and "
"it never leaves this machine."
msgstr ""

